Short:        REST API Handler
Author:       NovaCoder
Uploader:     novacoder yahoo co uk
Type:         dev/c
Version:      0.0.001
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.1.0
Distribution: Aminet

Overview:

This is a AmiSSL network handler written in C for using a REST API.
I used it for my game, G-WARS for an online high score table.
I've included a basic usage example.


